OL,3,GNEWSAPlea to reform 'unfair' police
OL,4,Afunding formula
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force could struggle to
OL,7,Fbalance next year's budget because of
OL,8,F"underlying unfairness" in the way its
OL,9,Ffunding is calculated, according to a
OL,10,Freport.
OL,12,FPhil Trussell, chief finance officer
OL,13,Ffor Cambridgeshire's Police and Crime
OL,14,FCommissioner (PCC), said "unfunded
OL,15,Fpopulation growth" in the county meant
OL,16,Fthe force could only support a
OL,17,F"baseline of public service and
OL,18,Fbusiness as usual".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
