OL,3,GNEWSAPlea to reform 'unfair' police
OL,4,Afunding formula
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report said an additional 15
OL,7,Fofficers were needed each year until
OL,8,F2041 to maintain current service
OL,9,Flevels.
OL,11,FA spokesperson for the Home Office said
OL,12,Fit had committed to reviewing the
OL,13,Fcurrent formula and that funding was at
OL,14,Fa "historic high".
